  "description": "In high school, Cheol-Ho's obsessive behavior towards Jin-Tae led to a fateful comment: \"\"I'll consider it if you ever turn into a girl.\"\" Years later, as adults, their paths cross again under shocking circumstances. Jin-Tae wakes up one day to find his body has inexplicably transformed. As they navigate this new and twisted dynamic, Jin-Tae must confront his transformed identity and the dangerous desires Cheol-Ho harbors. Will Jin-Tae find a way to reclaim control over his life, or will he be ensnared by Cheol-Ho's possessive grip?\"\n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
